   "detailed_description": "<h1>不朽帝國測試版現已推出</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/bc7d1e6810507ad48e8f1d05511bc659.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><br>「不朽帝國」是整個《Total War: WARHAMMER》系列的終章。全部三款遊戲*中的戰役地圖、種族與派系合而為一，創造出史詩級的沙盒戰役。這是史上最完整的決定版《Warhammer》戰略體驗！</p><br><h1>Join Our Discord Server</h1><p>",
   "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/4399b64b745c1a2f0c3a90f5c8958dcd.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/c7e59221c0150b58c9edc46f2f5b5a7b.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>垂死之神的最後一聲狂吼撕裂了世界間的界限，開啟了通往混沌魔域的傳送門。這股渦流之中出現了恐虐、納垢、奸奇、色孽四大毀滅之力，散佈黑暗和絕望。<br><br>驍勇的基斯里夫和遼闊的大震旦帝國在邊界堅守著，復仇心切的惡魔王子則發誓要摧毀腐蝕他的元兇。即將到來的衝突將會吞噬一切。你能否戰勝你心中的惡魔？又或是駕馭他們呢？ <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/8b527f5e70793d31e2544d34883539c2.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>七個獨特的種族和數百個單位任您號令，可供您組建軍隊，並在規模驚人且場面壯觀的世界之中，稱霸史詩級的即時戰鬥。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/53594a7d48dcf7a7ec302bb0addd31d1.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/19bf7acce8967b3bdc349df8b9c10a83.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>在《Total War》系列迄今最雄心勃勃、最具開創性的遊戲中，深入迷人的劇情之中，帶您往返匪夷所思的混沌魔域。在戰略沙盒中打造您的帝國，確保每場戰役必有新意。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/0d04020f1bac73bca6cdb2710c63d3f0.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/d9b284018f80bdc2b91aa00f8675a9c5.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>扮演10名傳奇領主！您會支持混沌諸神並選擇他們的惡魔勇士、扮演大震旦的古老變身神龍、與冰之女王一起保衛寒冰國度基斯里夫，還是扮演惡魔王子這樣的終極反派？<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/0e90bfa944229bb57cd64e99e3720ecf.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/f96fb179923fb4337d596fe4326d336c.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>利用種類豐富的身體部位和力量，將惡魔王子打造成自己的獨特設計，創造數十億種可能的組合，來搭配您專屬的遊戲風格。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/694fe09d6942684f8f104b301ed29250.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/b20d7515e0428e18a4dd32be2cad0db9.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>現在多人遊戲的規模變得更大了。憑藉龐大的8人混沌魔域多人戰役、激烈的1對1征服戰模式、以基斯里夫和大震旦為主軸展開的劇情導向多人戰役，以及排名戰和自訂戰鬥，與朋友一起製造混亂的方法要多少有多少。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/344243864c93aecc3521c90c0528c6da.avif?t=1790321531\" width=616 height=344 /></span>",
   "short_description": "《Total War: WARHAMMER》三部曲天翻地覆的大結局已到來。集結你的大軍前往混沌魔域。世界的命運將在這個匪夷所思的恐怖次元中決定。你能否戰勝你心中的惡魔…又或是駕馭他們呢？",
   "supported_languages": "英文<strong>*</strong>, 法文, 義大利文, 德文, 西班牙文 - 西班牙, 捷克文, 韓文, 波蘭文, 葡萄牙文 - 巴西, 俄文, 簡體中文, 繁體中文, 土耳其文<br><strong>*</strong>具備完整音效支援的語言",
   "reviews": "“Amazing!”<br>9/10 – IGN<br><br>“The ambition and the attention to detail is palpable with every click, and proof that Warhammer has surpassed history to become Creative Assembly’s premier product.”<br>9/10 – PCGamesN<br><br>“Creative Assembly’s most maximalist, chaotic, and arguably best game to date.”<br>Recommended – Eurogamer<br>",
